<title>USA: W.Virginia jobless rate climbs to 6.2 pct in June.</title>
<headline>W.Virginia jobless rate climbs to 6.2 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, W.Va. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Virginia's unemployment rate rose to 6.2 percent in June from 5.8 percent in May, state officials said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Jefferson County had the state's lowest unemployment rate in June, 2.9 percent, and Calhoun County had the highest, 13.8 percent.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
</text>
